
Annotations declared by plugins (their names start with @phan-x-):
- @phan-x-test-empty (CustomAnnotationTestPlugin)
- @phan-x-test-mark (CustomAnnotationTestPlugin): Marks an element for the test plugin
- @phan-x-test-second (CustomAnnotationSecondTestPlugin): Declared by the second test plugin
- @phan-x-test-shared (CustomAnnotationTestPlugin): Declared by both test plugins
- @phan-x-test-shared (CustomAnnotationSecondTestPlugin): Also declared by the first test plugin
